  "body": "Publishes the exact manifest-only SCAN Engine v0.23 source, deterministic ZIP/wheel, release receipts, and small v0.21\u2013v0.23 PR5 comparison evidence under Anchor. Updates the v0.30 checkpoint in the plan/report and preserves the four canonical Markdown documents aligned with the existing Google Drive folder.\n\nThe v0.23 NotepadNext certification is mechanically PASS (12/12 verified, 1,928/1,928 files) but PR5 calibration remains PARTIAL: 83 mapped + 74 partial compiler ASTs of 394 TUs, 311 explicit gaps, and unchanged 347/59/82 human-surface closure. The immutable v0.20 cold baseline and untouched H-001 holdout are unchanged. No specimen bytes, oracle material, or 238 MB sealed certification bundle are committed; the bundle SHA-256 is recorded in the release report.\n\nFrozen source copy audited 68/68 PASS; all 69 staged source blobs match frozen bytes; ZIP/wheel/package hashes match the freeze receipt. Engine development is paused for this repository synchronization.",
